    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build. Seduce. Conquer.</i><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The first\u00a0\u00a0</strong>Adult / Side-Scroller / Strategy blend!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are\u00a0<strong>Valerius</strong>, a disgraced Spartan warrior summoned to a divine city shrouded in mystery. Rebuild the shattered world of gods, lust, and betrayal. Rescue the lost\u00a0<strong>Holy Sisters</strong>, forge alliances, and unravel a conspiracy that threatens both mortals and immortals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae\u00a0<strong>Demo Available Now!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 1 + Village Mode:</strong>\u00a0Dive into Valerius\u2019 journey, rescue Astarte, and rebuild your first settlement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Demo (Coming Soon):</strong>\u00a0Episode 2 introduces dark mines, new characters, and intense romance scenes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Master fluid melee mechanics, powerful parries, and devastating attacks in side-scrolling action sequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <strong>Village Building:</strong> Rescue villagers, including captivating companions, and assign them roles, improving their lives and expanding your settlement.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Blend of Genres:</strong> Experience the perfect fusion of action-packed side scroller and thoughtful RTS gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Epic Storytelling:</strong> Discover the secrets of the island, guided by a mystical Oracle and the relationships you forge along the way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>\u0130ntense romance scenes:</strong> Let the ancient girls give the best rewards!\u00a0<br><br><br>Asset Transparency :\u00a0Character conversation portraits currently use AI-assisted tools as placeholders. All other assets (gameplay, environments, mechanics) are human-made. Final portrait replacements target Q4 2024.<br></p>",
